              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 880,
              "content": "4 px base spacing (2 and 10 kept as half-steps), seven radii from hairline bars to pills, and four opacity levels. Blocks, radii and tints are bound to their variables. Note: Pencil stores opacity variables as percent (40 = 0.4); tokens.json keeps DTCG 0–1 values — see pencil-mapping.json › transforms.",
