              "content": "Data table as a card (legacy Frame 2 · Booking & Produksi): toolbar with title + Segmented filter (C23), column header row, rows of typed cells (Avatar C16, Stage chip C12, Action menu C21) and a footer. Parts are separate components so screens compose any columns. Tokens: component.table.*.",
