                  "fill": "$color/semantic/text/secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 420,
                  "content": "1  Logo row — mark + wordmark (text.primary; monochrome until brand rules, GAP-03) + collapse (Icon Button Ghost SM)\n2  Divider — border.default, 1 px\n3  Workspace switcher — surface.panel + border.default, radius.sm, 8/12; mark = accent.highlight (brand marker, §2)\n4  Nav slot — groups gap 12 (space.3), items gap 4 (space.1)\n5  Spacer — the one allowed flexible spacer (SP7)\n6  Nav bottom slot — settings-type destinations\n7  Account — Avatar MD, name + email, log out (Ghost SM); avatar ↔ name 10 (§4.4)",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font/family/base",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
