              "fill": "$color/semantic/text/secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 880,
              "content": "The mobile counterpart of the Modal (C31): a docked sheet from the bottom edge over overlay.scrim. Owner pick 2026-09-26 (exploration board 05): option A “Docked” body (top corners radius.xl 24, rows with border.subtle, footer on surface.subtle) with option B’s header (no divider; centred title + meta for action lists, left title + round close for forms). Two components: Actions and Form. Tokens: component.sheet.*.",
