              "fontFamily": "$font/family/base",
              "fontSize": "$font/size/title",
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "rHVpn",
              "name": "Exhibit note",
              "fill": "$color/semantic/text/secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Source components. Sheet Item/Default · /Destructive (private base _SheetItem/Base; optional Count) fill the Actions and Menu sheets’ Items slots. Bottom Sheet/Actions = centred header + Items; Bottom Sheet/Form = leading header + round close, Body slot, footer with a full-width LG Actions slot; Bottom Sheet/Menu = Bottom Nav “Lainnya”: Sidebar logo + round close, then the Sidebar’s workspace switcher and every Sidebar destination not in the Bottom Nav, account at the bottom. Width 375 (design frame; code: 100% of the viewport, max 560 on tablets). Safe area = device bottom inset. Scrim is owned by the shell (C33 / C35), not the sheet.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font/family/base",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "EfLMH",
              "name": "Set grid",
              "width": "fill_container",
