                  "name": "Bullet",
                  "fill": "$color/semantic/text/secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "•  Actions sheet: 2–6 items; the destructive item is last, in sheet.item.text-destructive, and asks for a Form-sheet confirm.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font/family/base",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "$font/weight/regular"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "DrYvD",
                  "name": "Bullet",
                  "fill": "$color/semantic/text/secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "•  Form sheet: one short task (a choice, 1–3 fields); primary action full width; for a destructive confirm, Danger on top and Batal below.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font/family/base",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "$font/weight/regular"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "oIZka",
                  "name": "Bullet",
                  "fill": "$color/semantic/text/secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "•  Do: title names the object (actions) or the task (form). Don't: nest a sheet in a sheet, or put long scrolling forms in one — use a page.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font/family/base",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "$font/weight/regular"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "qXbjv",
                  "name": "Bullet",
                  "fill": "$color/semantic/text/secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "•  Height hugs content up to 90 % of the viewport; beyond that the Body scrolls with the header fixed.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font/family/base",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "$font/weight/regular"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "uoVbM",
                  "name": "Bullet",
                  "fill": "$color/semantic/text/secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "•  Dismiss: drag down on the grabber, tap the scrim, or Close/Batal.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font/family/base",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "$font/weight/regular"
                }
              ]
