              "content": "Single template. Status bar (54) and Safe area (34) are device insets — in code env(safe-area-inset-top/-bottom), never drawn by the app. App bar 52: Icon Button Ghost MD back (chevron-left) · Title (subtitle 16/700) · optional action. Content slot: padding space.4, gap space.3. Overlay (boolean, off): sheet.scrim over the whole screen, docks the Sheet slot (default Bottom Sheet/Actions) — its own Safe area replaces the screen’s.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font/family/base",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
