              "content": "A searchable Select: the Input is the search, the Menu lists matches, and a last “Tambah …” row creates a new record from the query (menu.item.text-action = action.primary). Built like the Multi-select: private base = instance of _Select/Base (C19) with its Menu slot replaced. Use for long or growing lists (clients, packages); use Select for ≤ 7 fixed options.",
