              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Template for tablet screens: Sidebar/Rail (72) + App Panel filling the rest (940 at 1024). Gutter space.3 top/right/bottom like the desktop shell. The Page Content Container is overridden to fill (max-width 1096 in code never triggers below 1280). Overlay (boolean, off) = scrim + Modal slot, sized 1024 × 768 (override on resized instances). Fill on a top-level instance: Replace(<shell>/<panel>/d2hCuQ/bBehO, …), active tab: Replace(<shell>/<rail>/<item>, Nav Rail Item/Active).",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font/family/base",
