                  "context": "App Shell · tablet template 1024 × 768 (768–1279). Nested: Sidebar/Rail (set the active Nav Rail Item), App Panel (Title, Actions, Content → Page Content; its Container is fill here — max-width 1096 still applies in code). Boolean: Overlay (off; Modal slot). Spec: docs/design-system/components/nav-rail.md",
